      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我在这段时光中，\n深刻地感受到了\n与圣王光环之间无可取代的情谊……",
      "source_fingerprint": "0790b06e305c081957e5b0c4c47f365718fc6b94e4ada19060fb6aa84fdc1ebb",
